{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他一想起那种安宁，就想退回去守着；这回带着想念做眼前的事，也在替它争取，心里反而有了劲。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着想念\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他重新尝到当初相信那种生活时的快乐，后来再怎么怀疑、疲惫，也没把它看轻。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新尝到\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再卖力也未必更靠近那种生活，若只顾硬撑，还可能把想留住的温柔磨掉。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没真正回来，他能稍稍松口气，却仍不知道眼前的努力最后能护住多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道往后还会累，真碰上要付出代价的时候，也可能又想退回安宁里。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他把绷着的劲松下来，仍清楚自己想护住那种生活，不必再靠拼命证明自己该往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"绷着的劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\", \"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把旧愿从想退回去守着的安宁，改成带着牵挂承担眼前事情的动力。保留行动与依恋共同推动的变化；R67与R68重复的判断合并，不再用抽象道理宣布整合完成。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日快乐重新回来，也保留愿望未成不等于从前的快乐白费。S13-1写行动与想念并存，S13-2写快乐没有被后来的怀疑和疲惫抹掉，不再重复两边互不否定的原则。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把投入更多不保证更接近旧愿、行动可能耗损珍贵之物，改成他具体担心硬撑会磨掉温柔。R76抽象的取舍总结并入这一条，保留行动方式必须受到珍惜之物限制的意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"合并现实尚未改变与最终能护住多少仍未知，保留行动没有保证、愿望尚未实现以及短暂松弛中仍有不安，不再重复结果未知。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来还会疲惫、真正面对代价时可能动摇甚至想退回安宁的风险，删去两种渴望同行却仍有冲突的抽象补充。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再需要反复证明自己才肯向前的变化，改成绷劲松开后仍清楚想护住什么，用具体心理收束末尾，不再重复靠忘掉一边换取安稳的原则。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df690183-0cf1-4a56-9b3c-f1d4bb26504d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232507821862Z", "elapsed_seconds": 198.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:28:26.723057+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8136af0a270b8b3ece66fe0da8a618e3b7d0c94c5044b80d4df5fc2a05271586", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232507821862Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8c2ae9a8e742577a9a53adb3d030edb05fc4a94cb271a0f4bc8df25420244472"}}}
